{"id":"huntik:page:3887","page_id":3887,"title":"Hopeshatter","kind":"spell","namespace":0,"summary":"Hopeshatter is a spell which takes a Titan out of battle directly, sending them straight back to their Amulet in a single shot. It is a powerful and deadly spell as it is even able to take out Titans such as Metagolem and Caliban.","profile":{"image":{"text":"File:S1E19_Rassimov_Hopeshatter.jpg","wikitext":"File:S1E19_Rassimov_Hopeshatter.jpg","links":[]},"aura":{"text":"White \n Black","wikitext":"White <br> Black","links":[]},"class":{"text":"Offensive","wikitext":"Offensive","links":[]},"users":{"text":"Dr. Rickman \nKiel \n Rassimov \n Shauna","wikitext":"[[Dr. Rickman]] <br>[[Kiel]] <br> [[Rassimov]] <br> [[Shauna]]","links":[{"target_title":"Dr. Rickman","label":"Dr. Rickman","target_id":"huntik:page:8577","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dr._Rickman","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A8577"},{"target_title":"Kiel","label":"Kiel","target_id":"huntik:page:4554","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Kiel","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4554"},{"target_title":"Rassimov","label":"Rassimov","target_id":"huntik:page:2090","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rassimov","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2090"},{"target_title":"Shauna","label":"Shauna","target_id":"huntik:page:3452","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Shauna","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3452"}]},"first":{"text":"\"Memory Lane\"","wikitext":"\"[[Memory Lane]]\"","links":[{"target_title":"Memory Lane","label":"Memory Lane","target_id":"huntik:page:5037","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Memory_Lane","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5037"}]},"frname":{"text":"Brise Espoir","wikitext":"Brise Espoir","links":[]}},"infoboxes":[{"name":"Infobox spell","parameters":[{"name":"image","value_wikitext":"File:S1E19_Rassimov_Hopeshatter.jpg","value_text":"File:S1E19_Rassimov_Hopeshatter.jpg","links":[]},{"name":"aura","value_wikitext":"White <br> Black","value_text":"White \n Black","links":[]},{"name":"class","value_wikitext":"Offensive","value_text":"Offensive","links":[]},{"name":"users","value_wikitext":"[[Dr. Rickman]] <br>[[Kiel]] <br> [[Rassimov]] <br> [[Shauna]]","value_text":"Dr. Rickman \nKiel \n Rassimov \n Shauna","links":[{"target_title":"Dr. Rickman","label":"Dr. Rickman","target_id":"huntik:page:8577","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dr._Rickman","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A8577"},{"target_title":"Kiel","label":"Kiel","target_id":"huntik:page:4554","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Kiel","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4554"},{"target_title":"Rassimov","label":"Rassimov","target_id":"huntik:page:2090","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rassimov","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2090"},{"target_title":"Shauna","label":"Shauna","target_id":"huntik:page:3452","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Shauna","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3452"}]},{"name":"first","value_wikitext":"\"[[Memory Lane]]\"","value_text":"\"Memory Lane\"","links":[{"target_title":"Memory Lane","label":"Memory Lane","target_id":"huntik:page:5037","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Memory_Lane","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5037"}]},{"name":"frname","value_wikitext":"Brise Espoir","value_text":"Brise Espoir","links":[]}],"start":0,"end":237}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"This spell was used by [[Rassimov]] in the [[Mausoleum of Sir Lancelot]] to vaporise the [[Ghost Trap]] that was attacking [[Dante Vale]] and [[Lok Lambert]]. {{source|Memory Lane}}\n\nRassimov used it to defeat [[Lindorm]] in the Amazon rainforest. {{source|Ladies' Choice}}\n\nRassimov uses the spell to defeat [[Freelancer]] whilst fighting Lok in [[Atlantis]]. {{source|Coming of Age}}\n\nRassimov used it in [[King Solomon's mines]] to defeat [[Kilthane]]. {{source|To Be Together}} \n\nIt was later used by [[Kiel]] in [[Medusa's Cave]] to defeat and escape [[Metagolem]]. {{source|Zhalia's Mission}} \n\nIt was later used by [[Shauna]] to defeat [[Caliban|Powerbonded Caliban]] whilst trying to prevent Dante from reaching the [[Red Comet]]. {{Source|The Spiral Mark}}\n\n{{Clear}}","text":"This spell was used by Rassimov in the Mausoleum of Sir Lancelot to vaporise the Ghost Trap that was attacking Dante Vale and Lok Lambert. [Memory Lane]\n\nRassimov used it to defeat Lindorm in the Amazon rainforest. [Ladies' Choice]\n\nRassimov uses the spell to defeat Freelancer whilst fighting Lok in Atlantis. [Coming of Age]\n\nRassimov used it in King Solomon's mines to defeat Kilthane. [To Be Together] \n\nIt was later used by Kiel in Medusa's Cave to defeat and escape Metagolem. [Zhalia's Mission] \n\nIt was later used by Shauna to defeat Powerbonded Caliban whilst trying to prevent Dante from reaching the Red Comet. [The Spiral Mark]"},{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\">\nS1E23 Rassimov Hopeshatter.png\nS2E50 Caliban Hopeshatter.png\nS1E18 Ghost Trap Hopeshatter.png\nHopeshafter.png\nHopeshafter Freelancer.png\n</gallery>","text":"S1E23 Rassimov Hopeshatter.png\nS2E50 Caliban Hopeshatter.png\nS1E18 Ghost Trap Hopeshatter.png\nHopeshafter.png\nHopeshafter Freelancer.png"},{"heading":"International Names","level":2,"wikitext":"{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|DUT=Hoopgruizer\n|FR = Brise-espoir\n|POR=Mata Esperança, Mata Ilusões, Quebra Ilusões\n}}\n\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Blood Spiral magic]]\n[[Category:Black-aura spells]]\n[[Category:White-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]","text":"Dutch: Hoopgruizer\nFrench: Brise-espoir\nPortuguese: Mata Esperança, Mata Ilusões, Quebra Ilusões"}],"full_text":"Hopeshatter is a spell which takes a Titan out of battle directly, sending them straight back to their Amulet in a single shot. It is a powerful and deadly spell as it is even able to take out Titans such as Metagolem and Caliban.\n\n== History ==\nThis spell was used by Rassimov in the Mausoleum of Sir Lancelot to vaporise the Ghost Trap that was attacking Dante Vale and Lok Lambert. [Memory Lane]\n\nRassimov used it to defeat Lindorm in the Amazon rainforest. [Ladies' Choice]\n\nRassimov uses the spell to defeat Freelancer whilst fighting Lok in Atlantis. [Coming of Age]\n\nRassimov used it in King Solomon's mines to defeat Kilthane. [To Be Together] \n\nIt was later used by Kiel in Medusa's Cave to defeat and escape Metagolem. [Zhalia's Mission] \n\nIt was later used by Shauna to defeat Powerbonded Caliban whilst trying to prevent Dante from reaching the Red Comet. [The Spiral Mark]\n\n== Gallery ==\n\nS1E23 Rassimov Hopeshatter.png\nS2E50 Caliban Hopeshatter.png\nS1E18 Ghost Trap Hopeshatter.png\nHopeshafter.png\nHopeshafter Freelancer.png\n\n== International Names ==","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox_spell\n| image = File:S1E19_Rassimov_Hopeshatter.jpg\n| aura  = White <br> Black\n| class = Offensive \n| users = [[Dr. Rickman]] <br>[[Kiel]] <br> [[Rassimov]] <br> [[Shauna]]\n| first = \"[[Memory Lane]]\"\n| frname = Brise Espoir\n}}\n'''Hopeshatter''' is a spell which takes a Titan out of battle directly, sending them straight back to their Amulet in a single shot. It is a powerful and deadly spell as it is even able to take out [[Titans]] such as [[Metagolem]] and [[Caliban]].\n\n== History ==\nThis spell was used by [[Rassimov]] in the [[Mausoleum of Sir Lancelot]] to vaporise the [[Ghost Trap]] that was attacking [[Dante Vale]] and [[Lok Lambert]]. {{source|Memory Lane}}\n\nRassimov used it to defeat [[Lindorm]] in the Amazon rainforest. {{source|Ladies' Choice}}\n\nRassimov uses the spell to defeat [[Freelancer]] whilst fighting Lok in [[Atlantis]]. {{source|Coming of Age}}\n\nRassimov used it in [[King Solomon's mines]] to defeat [[Kilthane]]. {{source|To Be Together}} \n\nIt was later used by [[Kiel]] in [[Medusa's Cave]] to defeat and escape [[Metagolem]]. {{source|Zhalia's Mission}} \n\nIt was later used by [[Shauna]] to defeat [[Caliban|Powerbonded Caliban]] whilst trying to prevent Dante from reaching the [[Red Comet]]. {{Source|The Spiral Mark}}\n\n{{Clear}}\n== Gallery ==\n{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\">\nS1E23 Rassimov Hopeshatter.png\nS2E50 Caliban Hopeshatter.png\nS1E18 Ghost Trap Hopeshatter.png\nHopeshafter.png\nHopeshafter Freelancer.png\n</gallery>\n\n== International Names ==\n{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|DUT=Hoopgruizer\n|FR = Brise-espoir\n|POR=Mata Esperança, Mata Ilusões, Quebra Ilusões\n}}\n\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Blood Spiral magic]]\n[[Category:Black-aura spells]]\n[[Category:White-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]","categories":["Black-aura spells","Blood Spiral magic","Magic","Offensive spells","White-aura spells"],"links":[{"target_title":"Dr. Rickman","label":"Dr. Rickman","target_id":"huntik:page:8577","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dr._Rickman","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A8577"},{"target_title":"Kiel","label":"Kiel","target_id":"huntik:page:4554","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Kiel","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4554"},{"target_title":"Rassimov","label":"Rassimov","target_id":"huntik:page:2090","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rassimov","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2090"},{"target_title":"Shauna","label":"Shauna","target_id":"huntik:page:3452","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Shauna","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3452"},{"target_title":"Memory Lane","label":"Memory Lane","target_id":"huntik:page:5037","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Memory_Lane","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5037"},{"target_title":"Titans","label":"Titans","target_id":"huntik:page:2010","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Titans","st